OL,3,CProgramme listings for SUN 16 NOV
OL,4,G2000FBartok: Piano Concerto No.2
OL,5,     GA thorough look at the week's
OL,6,     Gclassical music releases, plus
OL,7,     Gnews and the Radio 3 Disc of the
OL,8,     GWeek recommendation.
OL,9,G2100F20th Century Radicals
OL,10,     GKate Molleson and Gillian Moore
OL,11,     Gshine new light on the 'modern'
OL,12,     Gmusic of the 20th century. This
OL,13,     Gweek, Kate explores the
OL,14,     Gphilosophical musical world of
OL,15,     GTalib Rasul Hakim.
OL,16,G2200FNight Tracks
OL,17,     GSara Mohr-Pietsch presents an
OL,18,     Gadventurous, immersive soundtrack
OL,19,     Gfor late-night listening, from
OL,20,     Gclassical to contemporary and
OL,21,     Geverything in between.
